WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,740
I'm just a hotel owner

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:02,900
No heart for old things

3
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:03,860
I don't have this ability either

4
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,300
There is food and drink in the shop

5
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,500
It's absolutely safe if you only plan to rely on others

6
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,620
Wait until the points in the card are used up

7
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:09,860
I will kick you out immediately

8
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:15,360
I know, don't worry

9
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:16,400
The sky is falling

10
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,400
Dad is supporting me

11
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:21,260
Sure enough, things will get better day by day in the future.

12
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:23,100
Or food can heal people's hearts

13
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:36,340
How to open your mouth

14
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:40,600
Eat slowly and it's all yours
